{"title":"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> have a product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9370839bbb8a8037471714de7c7c5a52804b5a75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and satisfy:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85dd8837f8a759a1ba67e80dc3a7d35203110e2f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{rl} ab + a + b &amp; = 524 \\\\  bc + b + c &amp; = 146 \\\\  cd + c + d &amp; = 104 \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/730a04d09740e0b0f50d1140c614f6e7840e9bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a34bd773d8b012ab935c3d5b30707330367541ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }4 \\qquad \\text{(B) }6 \\qquad \\text{(C) }8 \\qquad \\text{(D) }10 \\qquad \\text{(E) }12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick, we can rewrite the three equations as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/9/c69ff61995ec8078c9bf4409fc88c4c2aa3811db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (a+1)(b+1) &amp; = 525 \\\\  (b+1)(c+1) &amp; = 147 \\\\  (c+1)(d+1) &amp; = 105 \\end{align*}\" width=\"158\" height=\"68\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18f7c048eec6b5a606ce3e562d46db932aaef01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(e,f,g,h)=(a+1,b+1,c+1,d+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />. We get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/6/e865cdbf7de09e7912d5b8b9b375510f8545b229.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} ef &amp; = 3\\cdot 5\\cdot 5\\cdot 7 \\\\  fg &amp; = 3\\cdot 7\\cdot 7 \\\\  gh &amp; = 3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7 \\end{align*}\" width=\"120\" height=\"66\" />\n</p><p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026bb71c09708994ead7a4ee100a03960a87c4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d01c839d9a3d61ad5fed637ed5425117eb23a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$fg$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" />. On the other hand, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026bb71c09708994ead7a4ee100a03960a87c4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> can not divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />, as it then would divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a579a3e0b6e212a90595f38efc2e731300265c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ef$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/026bb71c09708994ead7a4ee100a03960a87c4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> can not divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> divides both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. This leaves us with only two cases: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/7/1e70fed0e321620fd7018e84b695ed5f95f4afe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f,g)=(7,21)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/31362f86cdad422342b0e7bd4cfef23ba98fbbe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f,g)=(21,7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The first case solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c3215391e710853ccfcddc4f077583d919492c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(e,f,g,h)=(75,7,21,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />, which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/414b3ed0724e3ae4bb1a8a9730d1941fe0d792bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)=(74,6,20,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"18\" />, but then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc246538833721c96cf6103328f246b9f616c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abcd \\not= 8!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" />. We do not need to multiply, it is enough to note e.g. that the left hand side is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. (Also, a - d equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in this case, which is way too large to fit the answer choices.)\n</p><p>The second case solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/6439e70e45f349eb828fa66d3a6d53d905c3a9b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(e,f,g,h)=(25,21,7,15)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"201\" height=\"18\" />, which gives us a valid quadruple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48ea26bda8542c73e259556a8e53ed9ef41c8bdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)=(24,20,6,14)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"18\" />, and we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/8/4a8654d4ad559922d3d4cdccc4cc46584ae5804e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-d=24-14 =\\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zlzievV5e-U\">https://youtu.be/zlzievV5e-U</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gN14L_aitq0\">https://youtu.be/gN14L_aitq0</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12\" title=\"2001 AMC 12\">2001 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Prob